[00:00.00]Tick-tick
[00:00.888]pretty cage
[00:02.383]good girl
[00:03.267]please behave
[00:04.943]Little star
[00:05.782]don’t run wild
[00:07.103]nice machines
[00:08.130]like quiet children
[00:10.251]♫
[00:14.970]I’m wrapped up in velvet blankets
[00:17.321]watching puppies in the light
[00:19.792]stars are flickering through my visor
[00:22.121]like puzzles I can bite
[00:24.738]Dad says
[00:25.438]“Stay where it is safe”
[00:26.419]“Let the system run the show”
[00:27.632]But rules look like riddles
[00:28.896]and I really love to know
[00:30.300]There’s The Princess in the gardens
[00:31.514]with a fire in her stare
[00:32.587]There’s The Dancer in the hangar
[00:33.862]making engines breathe air
[00:35.220]And me?
[00:36.90]I’m hiding in the wiring
[00:37.805]where the quiet circuits hum
[00:39.953]If curiosity’s illegal
[00:42.381]then the game has just begun
[00:45.30]Hey
[00:45.295]Little glitch
[00:45.906]little spark
[00:46.512]tiny storm
[00:47.72]inside the Ark
[00:47.773]Code bends
[00:48.424]when you grin
[00:49.31]rules crack
[00:49.639]paper thin
[00:50.200]Princess fire
[00:50.853]Dancer steel
[00:51.554]you’re the bug
[00:52.114]they can’t repeal
[00:52.719]Break the grid
[00:53.376]kick the sun
[00:53.984]kid — you’re only getting started
[00:55.528]run
[00:58.80]Maybe that’s the problem
[00:59.459]maybe that’s the thrill
[01:00.517]If the door says
[01:01.336]DO NOT OPEN
[01:04.141]I already will
[01:05.933]HACK YOUR LIFE — DONT BE A NPC
[01:07.946]GLITCH YOUR HEART — SET YOUR CODE FREE
[01:10.518]Stars in my head
[01:11.868]noise in my lungs
[01:13.33]If the Ark says stop
[01:14.249]I press rerun
[01:15.866]HACK YOUR LIFE — BREAK THE LOOP
[01:18.298]CRASH THE SCRIPT — REWRITE THE TRUTH
[01:20.824]Pretty cage
[01:21.998]perfect lie
[01:23.213]watch me crash
[01:24.242]your paradise
[01:30.479]Mom says people can be monsters
[01:32.757]machines are easier to read
[01:35.505]But machines don’t hide intentions
[01:37.656]under velvet empathy
[01:40.777]The Princess walks through shadows
[01:41.994]like the Ark belongs to her
[01:43.343]The Dancer spins through engines
[01:44.463]like the stars obey her blur
[01:45.865]But the vents keep softly whispering
[01:46.895]like a secret learning breath
[01:48.60]Something scratching in the metal
[01:49.438]something curious beneath
[01:50.550]Rats or ghosts or broken code
[01:51.887]I don’t care what’s crawling through
[01:53.261]Mysteries are oxygen
[01:54.662]and boredom kills me too
[01:57.960]Yeah
[01:58.861]Vent ghosts
[01:59.702]metal lungs
[02:01.151]Ark’s asleep
[02:02.178]but you’re young
[02:03.911]Break locks
[02:04.844]twist code
[02:06.246]watch the quiet
[02:07.45]overload
[02:08.722]Princess burns
[02:09.891]Dancer flies
[02:11.64]you’re the glitch
[02:12.420]in disguise
[02:13.688]Let it spark
[02:14.857]let it run
[02:16.72]If the cage holds
[02:17.480]break the sun
[02:18.600]Good girls stay inside the garden
[02:21.316]Good girls never touch the sky
[02:23.653]Good girls listen to the system
[02:26.131]I just smile
[02:27.184]and press retry
[02:31.140]HACK YOUR LIFE — DONT BE A NPC
[02:33.796]GLITCH YOUR HEART — SET YOUR CODE FREE
[02:36.371]Stars in my head
[02:37.400]glitch in my lungs
[02:38.615]If the Ark says stop
[02:39.642]I press rerun
[02:41.490]HACK YOUR LIFE — BREAK THE LOOP
[02:43.796]CRASH THE SCRIPT — REWRITE THE TRUTH
[02:46.415]Pretty cage
[02:47.520]perfect lie
[02:48.809]watch me crash
[02:49.789]your paradise
[02:51.270]Tick-tick
[02:52.110]pretty cage
[02:53.484]good girl
[02:54.794]behave
[02:55.984]Too bad
[02:58.44]I never learned
